## 22. Designing for Future MCP SDK 2.x Migration

A recommended architecture is:

```text
Business Logic
      │
      ▼
Application Errors
      │
      ├── ValidationError
      ├── BusinessError
      ├── UpstreamError
      └── InternalError
      │
      ▼
Framework / MCP Adapter
      │
      ├── Current
      │      ↓
      │   FastMCP 3.4.5
      │   + MCP SDK 1.x
      │
      └── Future
             ↓
          MCP SDK 2.x
          or newer FastMCP
```

Application-level errors remain stable.

Only the adapter layer should need significant framework-specific changes.

For example:

```text
UpstreamTimeoutError
```

remains the same application concept regardless of MCP framework version.

This reduces future migration effort.

